purpose operation requireSessionUserId "Resolve the request's session cookie to its owning user id. Returns -1 when the cookie is missing OR the session row is absent OR the session has expired — callers treat any negative value as 'no auth' and respond 401."
invariant operation requireSessionUserId "Never throws; returns -1 on every failure path so callers do not need branch-on-error plumbing. Side-effects: reads cookie + does one SELECT against sessions."

